<template>
  <section class="scientific-workbench" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="science-title">
    <header class="science-head"><div><span>沃壤知行 · 土壤科学研究</span><h2 id="science-title">沃壤知行 · 分析中心</h2><p>从地图点位出发，判断基因与通路数据能够支持什么。</p></div><button type="button" @click="$emit('close')">返回地图 ×</button></header>
    <HoverSwitch as="nav" class="science-tabs" aria-label="分析中心"><button v-for="tab in tabs" :key="tab.id" type="button" :class="{active:active===tab.id}" @click="active=tab.id">{{ tab.label }}</button></HoverSwitch>
    <div class="science-body">
      <section v-if="active==='health'"><h3>土壤状态与研究问题</h3><p v-if="!point?.found" class="science-warning">请先返回地图并选择一个有数据的点位。</p><template v-else><p>位置 {{ point.lat.toFixed(4) }}° N，{{ point.lon.toFixed(4) }}° E · {{ resolution }} km 栅格。</p><div class="science-measures"><div v-for="metric in metrics" :key="metric.key"><small>{{ metric.label }}</small><strong>{{ metricValue(metric) }}</strong><small>{{ metricSource(metric) }}</small></div></div><p class="science-warning">目前健康评分规则未核验，平台不产生 SHI 或健康等级。地图点位与公开微生物样本未配对。</p></template><h4>研究问题</h4><p>这处土壤的氮素状态值得进一步研究吗？独立的公开微生物数据能否展示氮循环过程的分析方法，并指出获得田块级解释仍缺什么？</p><p>土壤指标描述状态；基因与通路提供过程线索。只有样本 ID、时间、地点和土层对应，才可做样本级关联。</p></section>
      <section v-else-if="active==='microbe'"><h3>微生物功能</h3><p class="science-warning">CNPS.cycle 已处理公开 KO 丰度表，用于独立演示；不是所选地图点位的测序数据。</p><div class="science-controls"><label>公开样本<select v-model="sample"><option v-for="id in catalog.samples" :key="id">{{ id }}</option></select></label><label>KEGG 模块<select v-model="module"><option v-for="item in catalog.modules" :key="item.id" :value="item.id">{{ item.id }} · {{ item.name }}</option></select></label><button type="button" :disabled="busy||!point?.found||!sample||!module" @click="analyze">{{ busy?'分析中…':'分析 KO 与通路' }}</button></div><p v-if="error" class="science-error" role="alert">{{ error }}</p><div v-if="result"><h4>{{ result.context.module_id }} · {{ result.context.module_name }}</h4><p><a :href="result.context.source_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener">KEGG 模块定义 ↗</a> · {{ result.context.observed_stages }}/{{ result.context.total_stages }} 个步骤在输入表中有完整 KO 组合</p><div class="science-stages"><div v-for="(step,index) in result.context.stages" :key="step.stage_id"><b>{{ index+1 }}. {{ step.label }}</b><span>{{ step.any_route_complete?'输入表中有相应 KO 组合':'输入表中未获得完整支持' }}</span><small>{{ step.required_kos.join(' / ') }}</small></div></div><p>当前相关 KO：{{ result.context.observed_kos.join('、')||'未检出' }}</p><h4>当前数据的支持程度：{{ result.context.status }}</h4><p>{{ result.context.reason }}</p><p>检出概率与功能支持概率：未估计，因样本级 QC 和注释质量缺失。</p><h4>尚未解决的问题</h4><ul><li v-for="gap in result.context.gaps" :key="gap">{{ gap }}</li></ul><button type="button" @click="active='agent'">进入下一步决策 →</button></div><p v-else>选择公开样本与模块后运行分析。缺少 QC 时系统只给出结构观察，不伪造生物学结论。</p></section>
      <section v-else-if="active==='agent'"><h3>Scientific Agent</h3><p>候选动作：质控、功能注释、通路步骤、文献来源、样本配对、停止并建议补测。</p><p v-if="!result">先在“微生物功能”中运行分析。</p><template v-else><button type="button" :disabled="busy" @click="suggest">{{ busy?'比较中…':'下一步分析建议' }}</button><div v-if="decision"><h4>{{ decision.chosen.label }}</h4><p>{{ decision.reason }}</p><div class="science-stages"><div v-for="c in decision.candidates" :key="c.action"><b>{{ c.label }}</b><span>收益 {{ c.benefit }} · 成本 {{ c.cost }} · 风险 {{ c.risk }}</span><small>透明评分 {{ c.score }}</small></div></div><p>固定基线：{{ decision.baseline_action }}。当前没有外部证据证明策略优于该基线。</p><button type="button" :disabled="busy" @click="execute">执行所选动作</button><p v-if="execution" role="status">{{ execution.state }}：{{ execution.result }}；{{ execution.after.note }}</p></div></template></section>
      <section v-else-if="active==='report'"><h3>研究报告</h3><p>汇总地图点位、公开 KO 案例、判断边界、缺口与行动。两类样本未配对，报告不会产生田块级微生物机制结论。</p><button type="button" :disabled="!result||busy" @click="download">下载 Markdown 报告</button><p v-if="!result">先完成微生物分析，才能生成报告。</p><p v-if="message" role="status">{{ message }}</p></section>
      <section v-else><h3>证据追溯</h3><ul><li>土壤点位：Soilmate {{ resolution }} km SQLite 数据库，经地图点位 API 查询。</li><li>微生物：CNPS.cycle 官方仓库已处理氮循环 KO 表，37 KO × 9 样本。</li><li>通路：项目侧结构化的 KEGG M00529、M00530、M00528 定义；正式科学解释前需领域复核。</li><li>检测概率：当前公开表缺必要 QC，未估计。</li><li>Agent：记录候选动作评分、选择原因和执行后状态；外部专家盲评待完成。</li></ul><p v-if="result"><a :href="result.context.source_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener">查看当前模块来源 ↗</a></p></section>
    </div>
  </section>
</template>

<script setup>
import HoverSwitch from './design-system/HoverSwitch.vue'
import {ref,watch,onMounted} from 'vue'
import {displayValue,displayUnit} from './dataDisplay.js'
const props=defineProps({point:{type:Object,default:null},resolution:{type:Number,default:5},previewValues:{type:Object,default:()=>({})},initialTab:{type:String,default:'health'}})
defineEmits(['close'])
const tabs=[{id:'health',label:'健康评价与问题'},{id:'microbe',label:'微生物功能'},{id:'agent',label:'科研 Agent'},{id:'report',label:'报告'},{id:'trace',label:'证据追溯'}]
const active=ref(props.initialTab),catalog=ref({samples:[],modules:[]}),sample=ref(''),module=ref(''),result=ref(null),decision=ref(null),execution=ref(null),completed=ref([]),error=ref(''),message=ref(''),busy=ref(false)
const metrics=[{key:'soil_ph',label:'pH'},{key:'soil_an',label:'AN'},{key:'soil_tn',label:'TN'},{key:'soil_soc',label:'SOC'},{key:'ece',label:'EC / ECE'}]
function metricValue(metric){const item=props.point?.values?.[metric.key];if(item?.value!=null){const val=displayValue(metric.key,item.value);return val==null?'未提供':String(val)+(displayUnit(metric.key,item.unit)?' '+displayUnit(metric.key,item.unit):'')}if(metric.key==='soil_an'&&props.resolution===5&&props.previewValues?.n01_an!=null)return String(props.previewValues.n01_an)+' (预览)';return '未提供'}
function metricSource(metric){const item=props.point?.values?.[metric.key];if(item?.value!=null)return 'Soilmate 点位值 · 单位按数据字典';if(metric.key==='soil_an'&&props.resolution===5&&props.previewValues?.n01_an!=null)return '研究预览图层 · 单位待核';return '当前点位无该指标'}
watch(()=>[props.point?.lat,props.point?.lon,props.resolution],()=>{result.value=null;decision.value=null;execution.value=null;completed.value=[]})
function payload(extra={}){return {lon:props.point?.lon,lat:props.point?.lat,res:props.resolution,microbial_id:sample.value,module_id:module.value,...extra}}
async function api(path,data){const r=await fetch('/api/scientific/'+path,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(data)});if(!r.ok){let e=await r.json();throw Error(e.detail||'接口不可用')}return r}
onMounted(async()=>{try{let r=await fetch('/api/scientific/catalog');if(!r.ok)throw Error('目录接口不可用');catalog.value=await r.json();sample.value=catalog.value.samples[0]||'';module.value=catalog.value.modules[0]?.id||''}catch(e){error.value='公开数据目录加载失败：'+e.message}})
async function analyze(){busy.value=true;error.value='';try{result.value=await (await api('analyze',payload())).json();decision.value=null;execution.value=null;completed.value=[]}catch(e){error.value='分析失败：'+e.message}finally{busy.value=false}}
async function suggest(){busy.value=true;error.value='';try{decision.value=await (await api('action',payload({completed:completed.value}))).json()}catch(e){error.value='行动建议失败：'+e.message}finally{busy.value=false}}
async function execute(){busy.value=true;try{execution.value=await (await api('execute',payload({action:decision.value.chosen.action}))).json();completed.value=[...completed.value,decision.value.chosen.action]}catch(e){error.value='执行失败：'+e.message}finally{busy.value=false}}
async function download(){busy.value=true;message.value='正在生成…';try{const text=await (await api('report',payload({action:decision.value?.chosen.action}))).text();const url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([text],{type:'text/markdown;charset=utf-8'}));const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='沃壤知行_研究报告.md';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),5000);message.value='报告已生成。'}catch(e){message.value='报告生成失败：'+e.message}finally{busy.value=false}}
</script>

<style scoped>
.scientific-workbench{position:fixed;inset:5vh 5vw;z-index:2400;background:#fbfcf9;border:1px solid #d9e3d8;box-shadow:0 24px 70px #18352644;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;border-radius:12px;color:#273d30;font:var(--text-body)/var(--leading-body) var(--font-ui)}.science-head{background:#214b36;color:#fff;padding:18px 25px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.science-head span{font-size:var(--text-caption);letter-spacing:.14em;color:#bdd3bc}.science-head h2{margin:3px 0;font:600 var(--text-section-title)/var(--leading-title) var(--font-display)}.science-head p{margin:0;font-size:var(--text-caption);color:#d7e6d6}.science-head button{color:#fff;border:1px solid #a9c6ab;background:transparent;padding:7px 11px;border-radius:5px}.science-tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;padding:10px 25px;border-bottom:1px solid #dce5da;overflow:auto}.science-tabs button{white-space:nowrap;background:transparent;border:0;color:#617468;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:5px}.science-tabs button.active{background:#e4eee2;color:#244d36;font-weight:700}.science-body{overflow:auto;padding:24px 30px 45px;max-width:1100px;width:100%;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.65}.science-body h3{font-size:var(--text-panel-title);margin:0 0 14px}.science-body h4{font-size:var(--text-item-title);color:#28543b;margin:19px 0 7px}.science-body p{font-size:var(--text-body);max-width:70ch;line-height:var(--leading-body)}.science-body button{border:0;background:#285c40;color:#fff;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:5px;cursor:pointer}.science-body button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}.science-warning{background:#f6efe2;border-left:3px solid #aa8654;padding:10px 13px}.science-error{color:#a14331}.science-measures{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:8px}.science-measures div{background:#eef4ed;padding:13px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.science-measures strong{font-size:var(--text-subheading);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.science-measures small{font-size:var(--text-caption);color:#68786d}.science-controls{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:end;flex-wrap:wrap}.science-controls label{font-size:var(--text-caption);color:#576e5c;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.science-controls select{font:inherit;font-size:var(--text-input);min-width:190px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #c8d6c8;background:white}.science-stages{border-top:1px solid #dbe5da;margin-top:10px}.science-stages div{padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dbe5da;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1.4fr 1fr;gap:10px;font-size:var(--text-caption)}.science-stages small{color:#718174}@media(max-width:700px){.scientific-workbench{inset:0;border-radius:0}.science-body{padding:17px}.science-head{padding:12px}.science-head h2{font-size:var(--text-section-title)}.science-measures{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.science-stages div{grid-template-columns:1fr}.science-tabs{padding:8px}}
</style>

